# PokeversePort -- GENERATED by tools/gba_pipeline/gba_world (do not hand-edit).
#
# Ports 425 real map(s) decoded from Pokeverse 1.4 PS SPLIT.gba into the Multiverse Hub as
# isolated gauntlet maps. Every id is baked at emit time (maps 107905+,
# tilesets 4276+, switches/variables 336000+), so the .rxdata under
# this mod's Data/ is already engine-ready and this script does NO runtime id
# remapping -- it only splices the tilesets into $data_tilesets and registers
# each map with MultiverseHub's existing GAUNTLET_MAP_BUILDERS / load_data
# interception.
#
# Depends on MultiverseHub (loads first via mod.json dependencies).
#==============================================================================
